# HP49g+/50g primary Stock launch over USB Kermit.
# Fresh stock defaults use USB for wire I/O. Enter Kermit server through the
# ordinary I/O menu; unlike the hidden RShift+Right shortcut this path is not
# sensitive to key-down ordering in the headless harness.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
7000 capture home-rpn

8000 tap files
9500 tap down
10000 tap enter
11500 tap down
12500 tap down
13500 tap down
14500 tap down
15500 tap down
17000 tap enter
19000 capture server-usb
21000 host-gate

# Install ARMToolbox/library 275 into Port 2 using the transferred SETUP
# program. HPCLANG sorts before SETUP in HOME, so the VAR softkeys are F1/F2.
1000 capture after-transfer
2000 tap two
2500 tap period
3000 tap enter
4000 tap var
5000 capture vars-before-install
6000 tap f2
14000 capture setup-evaluated
15000 chord on f3
19000 capture warmstart

# HPCLANG remains in HOME. Recall it, enter the installed ARMTo library, and
# launch through PrRUN.
20000 tap var
21000 capture vars-after-install
22000 tap f1
24000 capture hpclang-stack
26000 chord rshift two
27500 capture lib-menu
28500 tap f1
30500 capture armtoolbox
31000 monitor 65000
31500 tap f1
